  "texto": "That's why someone GOOD bores you. Your brain calls it 'suspicious'. Toxic feels 'familiar'. Healthy feels 'wrong'. That's what the hijack looks like. This doesn't happen because you're weak. It happens to the strongest people you know. Because it takes strength to survive chaos. And that strength is your way out. Next time you can't stop thinking about them... ...say this: It's not love. It's your brain, drugged. And a drug can be quit. Comment 'THIS IS REAL' if you recognized yourself. And send it to someone who needs to hear it.",
